  "title": "Run AI SREs without burning token budgets",
  "description": "Most AI SREs have an underlying cost per investigation of about $2 per alert. This makes it difficult for most enterprises to use AI SREs as a first-line solution for triaging alerts, based on token cost. In this session, we review the math and optimizations and show practival ways to bring the LLM cost of AI SREs into a manageable range, where running them on every alert becomes viable.",
